{# props: filters — يُبنى من ميزة "filters" في twilight.json (نطاق سعر، تصنيفات فرعية، علامات، خيارات) #}
<div class="filters-panel bg-white rounded-card shadow-card p-5 space-y-6">
    {% for filter in filters %}
        <div class="filter-group border-b border-neutral-100 pb-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-neutral-900 mb-3">{{ filter.name }}</h3>

            {% if filter.type == 'range' %}
                <salla-range-slider min="{{ filter.min }}" max="{{ filter.max }}" name="{{ filter.field }}"></salla-range-slider>
            {% else %}
                <ul class="space-y-2.5">
                    {% for option in filter.options|default([]) %}
                        <li>
                            <label class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-neutral-600 cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="{{ filter.field }}[]" value="{{ option.value }}"
                                       class="rounded border-neutral-300 text-accent focus:ring-accent">
                                {{ option.label }}
                                {% if option.count is defined %}<span class="text-neutral-400 text-xs">({{ option.count }})</span>{% endif %}
                            </label>
                        </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <button type="button" class="text-sm text-accent font-medium" data-action="reset-filters">
        {{ trans('common.clear_filters')|default('إعادة تعيين الفلاتر') }}
    </button>
</div>
